# parity.mjs's raw captures, the gzip files it writes in its default output (each case's and
# fan-out's .json.gz, and source.diff.gz). Its coverage.json, plan.json and other JSON stay
# visible. Committed evidence is a summary whose provenance records where a maintainer published
# the captures and their SHA-256 (CONTRIBUTING.md, Benchmark results).
/results/parity/**/*.gz
